  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Crackers_Wither_Storm_Performance/BH_CWSP_header.webp\" alt=\"Banner Header\">\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ftinyurl.com%252famy67484\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Crackers_Wither_Storm_Performance/BH_CWSP_promo.webp\" alt=\"Banner Bisecthosting\"></a></p>\n<h2><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Crackers_Wither_Storm_Performance/BH_CWSP_overview.webp\" alt=\"Banner Overview\"></h2>\n<p><strong>Cracker's Wither Storm Performance</strong> 是一款专注于性能优化的模组包，以 Wither Storm 模组为核心。设计让玩家专注于享受激烈的 Boss 战，而无需担心性能问题。感觉酷炫？在对抗这个超过100格的怪物时，使用你喜爱的着色器！</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/crackers-wither-storm-performance\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/available/curseforge_vector.svg\" alt=\"curseforge\"></a>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmodpack%252fcrackers-wither-storm-performance\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/available/modrinth_vector.svg\" alt=\"modrinth\"></a>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fkesselot\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy/donate/kofi-plural-alt_vector.svg\" alt=\"kofi-plural-alt\"></a></p>\n<h1>特色功能</h1>\n<ul>\n<li>[✔️] <strong>完全优化</strong> - 开箱即用，支持着色器。</li>\n<li>[✔️] <strong>Cracker's Wither Storm</strong> - 一个方块组成的怪物！随时准备战斗。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/N8tUm6N4Qc\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Crackers_Wither_Storm_Performance/BH_CWSP_discord.webp\" alt=\"Banner Discord\"></a></p>\n<h3>模组包备注</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>如果你是 YouTube 或内容创作者，请在本描述中添加指向本页面的链接，以便人们知道你正在使用的模组包。</strong></li>\n<li><strong>禁止在 Modrinth 或 CurseForge 上重新上传此模组包或其任何修改版本（包括重定向至其他网站）。</strong>（<em>除非获得本人明确许可</em>）</li>\n</ul>",
